1️⃣ Role of SysAdmin in DevOps
A SysAdmin already works with servers, networks, and operating systems. In DevOps, the same things are automated and integrated with development teams.
Example:
SysAdmin Work
DevOps Version
Manually configure servers
Use automation tools (Ansible, Terraform)
Deploy software manually
Use CI/CD pipelines
Monitor servers
Use Prometheus / Grafana
Manage infrastructure
Infrastructure as Code
So DevOps = Automated SysAdmin + Development collaboration.
